    "extract": "Godachi is one of the major pilgrim centres in Belagavi District and is located near Ramdurg Taluk, of Belgaum district, in the Indian State of Karnataka. Its temples include Veerabhadra, Kalamma and Maruti Temples.",
    "extract_html": "<p><b>Godachi</b> is one of the major pilgrim centres in Belagavi District and is located near Ramdurg Taluk, of Belgaum district, in the Indian State of Karnataka. Its temples include Veerabhadra, Kalamma and Maruti Temples.</p>"
